{"id":"00204","root":"uni00204_1","name":{"ja":"セシリア・チェロ","en":"Cecilia Cello"},"title":{"ja":"【初夏のチョコ】","en":"【Early Summer Chocolate】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【初夏のチョコ】 セシリア・チェロ","en":"【Early Summer Chocolate】 Cecilia Cello"},"element":"Science","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-06-13","limited":false,"characterId":55,"profile":{"ja":"米連の研究所で生まれた女の子。遺伝子操作で人工的に作られた彼女は、生まれつき強力な魔力を扱える。米連の研究者たちから英才教育を受けさせられて育ち、学力や身体能力も高い。生命無きモノに魔力を与え、彼女の意思通り操るという能力を持つが、魔力を激しく消耗してしまうのが欠点。それを補うため、かばんやポシェットには甘いお菓子をたくさん常備してある。自由気ままで抜けた子供のような性格と、裏腹に異性の目をくぎ付けにする容姿を併せ持つ。","en":"Cecilia Cello was born in a United States research facility. She is an artificially created girl whose genes were engineered to wield powerful magic from birth. Raised under the gifted-education program of American researchers, she excels academically and physically. She can imbue lifeless objects with magic and control them at will, though this drains her magical energy intensely. To compensate, she always carries a stash of sweet snacks in her bag and pouch. She has a carefree, childlike personality, yet her striking appearance captivates the opposite sex."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"民安ともえ","forms":[{"id":"uni00204_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[752,1504],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[119,238],"def":[92,184],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","220009"]},{"id":"uni00204_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1104,2208],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[188,376],"def":[134,268],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","220009","220010"]},{"id":"uni00204_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1456,2918],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[257,515],"def":[176,353],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","220009","220010"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja"