,"variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"セシリアだよ～、よろしく～♪　一緒にチョコ、食べに行こうね～？","en":"It's Cecilia~ nice to meet you~♪ Let's go eat chocolate together, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"はぁ～、今日もチョコがおいしい……","en":"Ahh~ the chocolate is delicious again today..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"わっ、チョコ溶けちゃってる！　でも……溶けたチョコも、これはこれで♪","en":"Whoa, the chocolate melted! But... melted chocolate is still good too♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"チョコはね、おいしいだけじゃないんだよ？　色んなお菓子に合うんだからね","en":"Chocolate isn't just tasty, you know? It goes with all kinds of sweets."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"なに、任務？　う～ん……え、報酬はチョコレート！？　行く行く！　頑張っちゃうね！","en":"What, a mission? Hmm... eh, the reward is chocolate!? I'm in, I'm in! I'll give it my all!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"はい、あなたにもおすそ分け♪　一粒だけど、よ～く味わって食べてね？","en":"Here, a little share for you~ just one piece, savor it well, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"難しいことは、よくわかんないけど……毎日、甘いお菓子とチョコレートがあって、しあわせだよぉ♪","en":"I don't get the hard stuff, but… having sweet snacks and chocolate every day makes me happy~"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"え？　そんなことないよ、一人で食べるより、みんなで食べるほうがおいしいよ？　お腹空いてたら、一人で食べちゃうこともあるけど……","en":"Huh? No way, eating alone is fine but sharing with everyone is tastier, right? If I'm hungry I might eat alone though..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00204_1/uni00204_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[50],"scenes":[["chr_0130_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0130a_r18"]],"obtain":[],"standardPool":true,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00204","graph